sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant User as User / CI Pipeline
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Kueue Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Controller as Kueue Controller Manager
    participant Scheduler as Kueue Scheduler<br/>(internal goroutine)
    participant Cache as Cache + Queue Manager<br/>(in-memory)
    participant RemoteK8s as Remote Kueue Cluster<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant CA as Cluster Autoscaler

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over User,Cache: Flow 1: Job Admission
        User->>K8sAPI: POST Job/PyTorchJob/RayJob<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-*<br/>TLS, API server auth
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated (suspended, queue label set)
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-*<br/>TLS, API server auth
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admitted
        K8sAPI-->>User: Job created (suspended)

        Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch Job events<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Job created event
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Workload CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

        Controller-->>Cache: Enqueue Workload
        Scheduler->>Cache: Dequeue next Workload
        Scheduler->>Cache: Check ClusterQueue quota<br/>(ResourceFlavors, Cohort borrowing)
        Cache-->>Scheduler: Quota available

        Scheduler->>K8sAPI: Update Workload status (admitted)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Unsuspend Job<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>User: Job pods scheduled
    end

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over Controller,RemoteK8s: Flow 2: MultiKueue Federation
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch MultiKueueConfig/Cluster CRs
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: MultiKueue config
        Controller->>RemoteK8s: Create remote Workload<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
        RemoteK8s-->>Controller: Watch remote Workload status<br/>(long poll)
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Update local Workload status
    end

    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        Note over Controller,CA: Flow 3: Provisioning Request
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create ProvisioningRequest + PodTemplate<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        CA->>K8sAPI: Watch ProvisioningRequest
        CA->>K8sAPI: Update ProvisioningRequest status<br/>(capacity provisioned)
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Read ProvisioningRequest status<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Update Workload AdmissionCheck<br/>(check passed)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over Controller,K8sAPI: Metrics & Health
        Controller->>Controller: Expose /metrics :8443 HTTPS<br/>Bearer Token + TokenReview
        Controller->>Controller: Expose /healthz /readyz :8081 HTTP
        Controller->>Controller: Expose Visibility API :8082 HTTPS<br/>Delegated auth
    end
